    schedule: [{ level: 4, count: 2 }, { level: 7, count: 2 }, { level: 9, count: 2 }, { level: 12, count: 2 }]
    note: "Select eight other skills, plus TWO more at each of levels four, seven, nine and twelve - a schedule of 4/7/9/12 rather than the 3/6/9/12 most of this book uses, and two picks at every step rather than tapering. Espionage is barred outright and is absent. TWO PRINTED BONUSES ARE NOT CATEGORY BONUSES AND ARE NOT STORED: Science is Any (+10% ON MATH) and Technical is Any (+10% ON LANGUAGE AND COMPUTER SKILLS) - each names particular skills inside a category, and a category bonus would hand the percentage to every pick. Pilot is Any (+10% WHERE APPLICABLE), which is stored as a flat +10% because the qualifier names no exception."
  secondary_skills:
    count: 7
    note: "Seven secondary skills from the same list, without the bonuses in parentheses, starting at the base skill level. The any/only/none limits above still apply."
